WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A design review argues from evidence: requirements, views, dimensions, interfaces and unresolved questions. A polished render is not verification.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Present one visible claim, one supporting drawing, one counterexample to check and one next measurement.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Portfolio critique

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

